1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Power seat suddenly won't move?
Don't assume the motor's dead yet.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
No hum, no click, nothing at all
when you press the switch.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One clue: a blown fuse or corroded
connector can look identical to a dead motor.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Chase the wrong part first and you
can pay for a motor you didn't need.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't guess which one it is
before you check.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before you replace
the wrong part. Nick's Tire & Auto.
